body='<h1>Microduck head peripherals sourcing</h1><p>2026-09-08 · MD-HEAD-PERIPHERALS-20260908-A</p><p><b>Original speaker, LED/eye board and NFC identities remain unknown. Conditional sourcing only.</b></p><h2>Speaker routes</h2><p>The35×25×7mm mesh is a placeholder, not an impedance or cavity specification. ABRA SPK-3525-2W-GH is35×25×6.8mm,8Ω,2W,$2.95USD and listed in stock; retail extensions at1/100/1000 pieces:$2.95/$295/$2950. Manufacturer and production fit remain unknown.</p><p>Thingbits TH1504 / XHXDZ-3525-8R2W is35×25×6.2mm and sold out at₹105.02 including GST. Its8 Ω title, 9 Ω table and 4 Ω / 3 W heading conflict: hold for corrected specifications. Hubtronics offers another3525 family listing; height and direct capture were not verified.</p><h2>NFC routes</h2><p>PN7150B0HN/C11002Y: LCSC C702907 displayed9,891pieces;$5.6605/$3.9283/$3.6333 at1/100/1000. DigiKey is a second exact candidate route with no current price verified. ST25R3916-AQWT: LCSC C2908147 displayed93pieces;$5.4212/$3.6349/$3.3072 at1/100/1000. Larger quantities exceed stock; DigiKey second route retains only dated evidence. These controllers have different architectures and are not interchangeable.</p><p>Molex1462360111 and Taoglas20×20×0.355mm NFC flex provide manufacturer antenna RFQ routes. Neither establishes an original antenna, reader power compatibility or tuning in the assembled head/beak. Two advertised antenna locations do not fix controller count.</p><h2>LED and eye board</h2><p>No original LED package, colour, count or eye PCB has been identified. Current runtime roadmap still says the tested hardware lacks a software-controlled indicator, while the presskit promises one. PublicHAT D1/D2/D4 are protection diodes;U1 isPAM8406D audio amplifier. Do not mistake them for eyeLED circuitry.</p><p>For a separately approved bench candidate, KingbrightAPTD1608LSECK/J3-PF has exact DigiKey and Mouser routes; both current direct price captures were blocked. It is a625 nm 0603 red LED, not proof of the original indicator. No LED board manufacturing offer can be specified without its drawing.</p><h2>What closes identity</h2><ul>'+''.join('<li>'+e(x)+'</li>' for sec in ['speaker','nfc','led_eye'] for x in r[sec]['settles'])+'</ul><h2>Sources and inquiry status</h2><p>'+e(r['rfq'])+'</p><ul>'+''.join('<li><a href="'+e(x['url'])+'">'+e(x['id'])+'</a> '+e(x.get('error','captured; SHA-256 in manifest.json'))+'</li>' for x in m)+'</ul><p>Exact facts, conditional routes, manufacturer datasheets and retained evidence hashes are in audit.json.</p>'
